-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. August to September and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025, September to October came in at 48% of normal. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 29% and March to April at 181% on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
